# Cloudflare Pages Redirects
#
# Cloudflare Pages natively handles Single Page Application (SPA) routing:
# Any route that does not match a static asset automatically falls back to /index.html (200 OK)
# as long as no top-level 404.html file is present in the build output.
#
# Note: Do NOT add "/* /index.html 200" here. On Cloudflare Pages, that rule triggers:
# "Infinite loop detected in this rule and has been ignored" (Code: 10021).
#
# Define any custom 301/302 redirects or path rewrites below:
# Format: <source> <destination> [code]
# Examples:
# /old-route /new-route 301
# /docs/*    /documentation/:splat 301
